over the last few months?

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:59.700
- You know, I'm in Nashville,
and so I'm very thankful,

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:02.280
because there's some normalcy,
I'm out in the country.

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:03.900
And my kids have been in school,

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:05.400
you know, since early August.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:06.520
And I don't know,

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:07.820
it's just a little bit
different out there,

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:09.240
so I'm really thankful that we're there.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:10.840
And during the whole pandemic,

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.830
I was able to tell my kids to go outside

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:15.410
