00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:31.000
So I felt like we were in
a very fortunate position.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.220
- Wow, that is awesome.

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:34.070
Man, 'cause homeschool, that all,

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:36.307
