00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:20.210
So there's a few items up there

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:22.080
from the new Demi-Fine collection as well.

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:23.900
- That's exciting, that's so cool.

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:28.850
So you decided to end your
show "Very Cavallari",

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:30.680
